      "id": "privacy-security",
      "title": "Privacy & Security",
      "layout": "topics",
      "description": "<p class=\"p4a-1c\">The choice to live a private and safe life should be <b>available</b> and <b>accessible</b> to everyone.</p>\n<p class=\"p4a-1d\">There are plenty of steps you can take to better understand your options, and start cutting down the amount of data that may be available about you without your knowledge.</p>\n<div class=\"p4a-1e\">\n<span class=\"p4a-1f\">←</span>\n<p class=\"p4a-1c\">The manuals here are digestible for any experience level.</p>\n</div>",
      "items": [
        "browsers",
        "data",
